 # 20\. Defect Management

 When a defect is identified, it should be recorded and managed through the following process:

```
Identify Defect
      ↓
Record Defect
      ↓
Determine Severity
      ↓
Fix Defect
      ↓
Retest
      ↓
Close Defect
```

 Example:

 | Defect | Severity | Resolution |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Empty question accepted | Medium | Added input validation |
| Incorrect score calculation | High | Corrected evaluation logic |
| API error not displayed | Medium | Added error handling |
| Mobile layout issue | Low | Improved responsive CSS |

