 ## Conclusion

 The testing phase of **EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant** verifies the correctness, reliability, security, usability, and performance of the complete system. Testing individual modules as well as their integration with the Gemini API and database helps identify defects before deployment and ensures that the final application meets its defined requirements.
